.TH FATHOM_STATS 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-stats \- Report repo scale, index state and cache hit rate
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom stats\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIROOT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report repo scale, index state and cache hit rate
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the same report as JSON, for a machine
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIROOT\fR] [default: .]
The repository to report on
